    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853640/extras/445e45047f173c736f7fa09ce5efa168.avif?t=1755797711\" data-has-big width=1600 height=748 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Berserker Girl</strong> is a 2.5D side-scrolling action game with tight platforming, intense boss battles, and a rich narrative told in a visual novel style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl wakes up in a strange, otherworldly realm. With no idea how she arrived, she sets off in search of the <strong>King of All</strong> \u2014 a being said to hold the key to returning home. Along the way, she\u2019ll battle shadowy foes, traverse surreal landscapes, and uncover fragments of a world both beautiful and broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fast-paced, responsive combat</strong> and challenging platforming<br>\ud83d\udcd8 <strong>Story-driven progression</strong> presented through visual novel-style dialogue<br>\ud83e\uddca <strong>3D character models</strong> in a unique 2.5D visual style<br>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Atmospheric and mysterious worldbuilding</strong> with hidden lore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by HyperSoftMongsilSoftware \u2014 a tiny studio inspired by one very soft rabbit named Mongsil.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853640/extras/445e45047f173c736f7fa09ce5efa168.avif?t=1755797711\" data-has-big width=1600 height=748 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Berserker Girl</strong> is a 2.5D side-scrolling action game with tight platforming, intense boss battles, and a rich narrative told in a visual novel style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl wakes up in a strange, otherworldly realm. With no idea how she arrived, she sets off in search of the <strong>King of All</strong> \u2014 a being said to hold the key to returning home. Along the way, she\u2019ll battle shadowy foes, traverse surreal landscapes, and uncover fragments of a world both beautiful and broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fast-paced, responsive combat</strong> and challenging platforming<br>\ud83d\udcd8 <strong>Story-driven progression</strong> presented through visual novel-style dialogue<br>\ud83e\uddca <strong>3D character models</strong> in a unique 2.5D visual style<br>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Atmospheric and mysterious worldbuilding</strong> with hidden lore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by HyperSoftMongsilSoftware \u2014 a tiny studio inspired by one very soft rabbit named Mongsil.</p>",
